2. 交错消费 (interleaved consumption: branch A, fallback, branch B, branch A → independent cursors; exhaustion reuses last item)
3. 拒绝不消费 (400 rejection doesn't consume; next valid request gets expected item)
4. 重载期间旧延迟响应 (old delayed response during reload keeps old item/version; reload resets counters; failed reload keeps positions)
5. 记录 (records distinguish branch/fallback/none, sequencePosition/Length match selected sequence, plannedResponse matches wire)
6. Config validation: GET with branches rejected, POST without requestBody with branches rejected, duplicate ids, invalid pointer, invalid condition value, empty when, empty responses, unknown fields — all rejected with location.
7. Conditions semantics: missing vs null, no coercion, 0/-0, array index, empty field name, __proto__, escapes.
8. import: preserves branches; removal of rule with branches → exit 2, stderr, empty stdout.
9. compare: branch changes don't affect conclusion.

Let me look at test/helpers.ts to reuse utilities.

